'''Yamaoka Minori''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that could be unlocked by using a [[Serial Codes|Serial Code]] (みの - りん). She was added in [[Version 3.8 Update|Version 3.8]]. As of [[Version 4.3 Update|Version 4.3]], she is now unobtainable because Serial Codes can no longer be input to the game.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 192
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Yamaoka Minori
|name2 = Queen Minori
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Queen Minori''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Yamaoka Minori is entirely outclassed by [[Onmyoji Cat (Rare Cat)|Onmyoji Cat]] due to her pathetic range and staggering recharge time.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller & User Rank Dump}}

